The sample represents a clinical trial in Phase3 for patients with Multiple Myeloma in Relapse, Refractory Multiple Myeloma. The trial involves the drugs tj202, lenalidomide and dexamethasone, lenalidomide and dexamethasone. The eligibility criteria for inclusion in the trial include Inclusion Criteria:

